{"ID":"20240118145001-y7ojn41","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240118145001-y7ojn41","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118145001-y7ojn41\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118145001-bna5cx6\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122165024-bozpqw4\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122165024-bozpqw4\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:354,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:414\u0026#125;","title":"362补05赤小豆","type":"doc","updated":"20240204160338"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240118145001-bna5cx6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240118145001-bna5cx6","updated":"20240122165002"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【产地】处处有之，以紧小者为良。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122165004-ctuhpne","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122165004-ctuhpne"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【性味】味辛（或作甘酸）性平，无毒。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122165006-oxyr879","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122165006-oxyr879"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【主治】赤小豆为行水散血，消肿解毒要药，主排痈肿脓血，水气肿账，治脚气，利小便，疗一切痈疽恶疮发背，内外可用。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122165009-se8obm7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122165009-se8obm7"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【别录】疗寒热，热中消渴，止泄痢，利小便，下腹胀满，吐逆卒澼。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122165011-woyvcf4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122165011-woyvcf4"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【甄权】治热毒，散恶血，除烦满，通气，健脾胃，令人美食，捣末同鸡子白涂一切热毒痈肿，煮汁洗小儿黄烂疮，不过三度。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122165013-2g9ijab","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122165013-2g9ijab"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【士良】缩气行风，坚筋骨，抽肌肉。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122165016-xl30nuy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122165016-xl30nuy"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【孟铣】散气，去关节烦热，令人心孔开，暴痢后气满不能食者，煮食一顿即愈，和鲤鱼煮食，甚治脚气。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122165018-9inyla8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122165018-9inyla8"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【日华】解小麦热毒，煮汁解酒毒，解衣粘缀。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122165020-5ewkjik","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122165020-5ewkjik"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【容川】赤小豆发芽，则能透达脓血。（黏涩又味甘，能填补止泻利。）"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122165022-o82wxof","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122165022-o82wxof"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【用量】普通钱半至三至四钱。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122165023-carz3ck","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122165023-carz3ck"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【禁忌】合鱼鲊食成消渴，作酱，同饭食成口疮，久服则降令太过，津血渗泄、令人肌瘦身重。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122165002-4r97tb1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122165002-4r97tb1"}},{"ID":"20240122165024-3l6x48w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122165024-3l6x48w"}},{"ID":"20240122165024-bozpqw4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122165024-bozpqw4","updated":"20240204160338"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这个第五个呢赤小豆，那赤小豆呢跟红豆长的很像，我们挑越紧小越小越细小的呢越好，味辛性平无毒，赤小豆呢主要是行水，散淤。我也使用的很多，赤小豆，甚而至于包括痔疮，外痔我都加赤小豆，很好，赤小豆跟当归能够排血，那消肿解毒，赤小豆能够消肿解毒，所以排痈肿脓血，那一切的痈疽恶疮像肛门痔疮就是淤肿啊对不对，啊赤小豆，这个【甄权】呢，它说这个治热毒，能够散热血，那这个【孟铣】呢他说和鲤鱼一起煮，甚而可以治脚气，赤小豆跟鲤鱼煮在一起，那它本身呢你看它行水散血，所以说解一些毒啊喝酒吃太多啊酒毒啊统统可以治，凡是身上的湿热都可以使用赤小豆，湿热很盛的统统可以使用赤小豆，那个煮起来当然没有像红豆那么好吃，也会有红豆的样子，好像煮不烂的红豆的感觉。那非常好用，一般我们用赤小豆的剂量呢三钱，有时候大剂量五钱，五钱就很多了，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"一般豆类的药，豆子我们就会尽量放在水里面泡一下，泡个三四十分钟然后开火去煮他让它水分能够吸收一下再去煮，让它煮的更烂一点"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，那时间多点泡一个小时都没有关系。"}]}]}